schemaVersion: 1
id: discord-feedback-root
name: Discord Feedback
kind: root
version: 0.3.0
description: "Turns what your Discord community asks for into one ranked board of requests, with who asked and links to their messages."
entry: index.md
domain: Operations
app: board
connectors:
  - id: discord
    need: needs
    access: [read, post]
    why: "Reads your feedback channels. Posts only after your yes in the chat."
prompts:
  - text: What do people ask for most right now?
    connector: discord
  - text: Which bugs did people report this week?
    connector: discord
  - text: Who asked for the top request, and what did they say?
    connector: discord
  - text: Which channels do you read as feedback?
    connector: discord
  - text: Write a spec for the top request
  - text: Which requests did we ship, and who should hear about it?
